# Force LF endings for every text file, on every platform.
#
# Why this is load-bearing and not boilerplate: on the OnlineWhiteboard
# project, a CRLF ending that Windows git silently wrote into .env corrupted
# POSTGRES_PASSWORD inside the Linux container (the password became
# "hunter2\r", which is a different password). Docker bind-mounts do not
# normalize line endings for you. Forcing LF at the repo level makes the
# whole class of bug unrepresentable.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files that must never be end-of-line normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
